      "settings": {
        "headline": "",
        "large_headline": "",
        "copy": "<p>Skin laxity is one of the most common concerns I hear, from the face to the arms, abdomen, and flanks. As a plastic surgeon, a significant portion of what I do is about tightening. And for years, I have watched aesthetic technologies overpromise and underdeliver in this space, leaving the most meaningful interventions to the operating room.</p><p><em><strong>OndaPro is different. I do not say that lightly</strong></em></p>"
      }
    },
